# Lure of the Wildcat (Windurst) (windurst 94): the guard xi.settings.main.ENABLE_TOAU == 1 with the setting a boolean:
# Lua's `true == 1` is false: not offered, Ibwam's own script (740). A port that reads true as 1 (Settings.MainNumber /
# Main) would offer it; Settings.MainEquals (quest rework P9) does not. Then 1: 736 (its finish gives the badge and begins
# it). Recorded on Lua at 1b422a9f^ (the parent of the commit that deleted the Lua).
lists WindurstWoods/Ibwam/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/736
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=-24,2.75,-59 job=WAR lvl=20
setting ENABLE_TOAU true
login
trigger Ibwam                             # ENABLE_TOAU true: not offered; 740
finish
setting ENABLE_TOAU 1
trigger Ibwam                             # ENABLE_TOAU 1: 736
finish                                    # the Green Sentinel Badge; begun
